<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Mbunga Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lihamba lya mtumbulo lya Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Pet</para>
  <para style="mt2">Lihamba lya mtumbulo lya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petelo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongulelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Lihamba lya mtumbulo lya Petelo iyandikilwi na Mndumindumi Petelo. Petelo angutumbula lihamba hai kwa kulonga yiwa mweni ni ghani na kutambulisa wala anguwayandikila ni mkina ghani. Awayandikilili lihamba hai Wakilisito wogha wavile “Wahenja kumlimawogha” lihamba lya mtumbulo gha Petelo 1:1; 1:17; 2:11. Mihanja itangala awakemili nagha wandu awayandikilili kwaikiva walandalili kumahala yatangala kumlimawogha. Kwaikiva kwa fwasi itenu lihamba hai ilandana na lihamba ayandikili Paulo kwa wandu wa Efesu, wandu watangala wakwinilili yiwa lihamba lya mtumbulo gha Petelo iyandikilwi badili gha hila lihamba gha Paulo kwa Waefesu paghati gha machuva gha 65 badili gha kuwelekwa kwa Kilisito. Petelo ayandikili lihamba hai akiva ku Loma kula apakemili Babuloni ku Sula gha 5:13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mghalu mkulunga nesu umghola Petelo kuyandika lihamba hai ni kuwataya moyu na kuwalongela yiwa hagha chakaka ni manemu gha Sapanga ku Sula gha 5:12. Kuvile na mighalu itangala ilandana paghati gha lihamba lya mtumbulo gha Petelo Sula gha 2:11-3:7 na hula wa Waefesu Sula gha 5:18-6:9 na yala yayandikwa ku Wakolosai Sula gha 3:18-4:6. Mayandiko gha mahala hyogha itatu yanguyegha malaghililo yailongela vila kaya zyao zingupalwa kulama na kutundamila ulongosi. Kangi kawataya moyu wakilisito kuwela wagangamala hata pakawela na maghaso kwaikiva machuwa gha mwihu gha pabehi 4:1.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gha mghati</para>
  <para style="io">Petelo angujimanyisa mweni na wala anguwayandikila lihamba ghaki lihamba lya mtumbulo gha Petelo ku Sula gha 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io">Angumshukwile Sapanga kwa ukombola hula wawela nau na vila ungumaanisa kukulama kwa weni kulihamba lya mtumbulo gha Petelo ku Sula gha 1:3-2:10.</para>
  <para style="io">Petelo anguwalaghila wahenja kulikala maha angulonga na wakwinila vila wangupalwa kulikala handa mlumi na mdala ghaki na mhusutu na bambu ghaki kulihamba lya mtumbulo gha Petelo ku Sula gha 2:11-4:11</para>
  <para style="io">Petelo anguwataya moyu wakilisito vila wangupalwa kufumilila pawanguhakilwa lihamba lya mtumbulo gha Petelo ku Sula gha 4:12-5:11</para>
  <para style="io">Petelo angutimilila lihamba ghaki ku Sula 5:12-14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />lihamba hai ni kuhuma kwa nenga Petelo, mndumindumi wa Yesu Kilisito, ninguwayandikila mwenga</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">wahaghulwa wa Sapanga, mvile mlandala na mtyelembukila haku na mngulikala handa wahenja ku Ponto na Galatia, na Kapadokia na Asia na Bisinia. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Tati Sapanga awahaghulili mwenga kwaikiva gha lukani lwaki na awamanyili kuhuma dahile, na mgholwa kuwela wahaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga kwa Mpumulo ghaki, ili mpati kumkwinila Yesu Kilisito na Kughululwa kwa mwahi ghaki.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Ninguwatakila ulungwana na kulikala kwa kuponga.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Litumaini lyeni ukomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ahighilwe Sapanga na Tati wa Bambu wa twenga Yesu kilisito! kwa luhungu lwaki lukulu akatughola tuwelekwi kangi ku uhinduki wa Yesu kuhuma kwa wahovili. Katupegha litumaini lyeni ukomu, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />hinu tungulindila kulihi yala yavile Sapanga katuvikila wandu ghaki. Sapanga katuvikila highili hasi kundumba zivile ziwesa ng'ogha kuwola au kukologhanyika au kusisila. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Mighalu hai ni kwaikiva gha mwenga ivile kwa njila gha ukwinila mngugholokelwa na makakala gha Sapanga kwaikiva gha ulokola hula uyandalwa kala kuhighiliswa lipindi lya mwihu.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Mhekeleli nesu kwaikiva gha mghalu hau, pamonga na yiwa hinaa mngung'ung'uliswa kwa lipindi mayaghani kwaikiva gha mayesu wekaweka. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Mayesu hagha yawahikila ili kuhighilisa ukwinila wa mwenga ivile ghamaha kupiti zahabu, pamonga na kuyeswa kulyoto ili iwoneki yiwa ghamaha hata ikawela ingupela. Ili ukwinila wa mwenga uyeghi umaheli wa mwenga na ukwilikihi na utundamilu lipindi Yesu Kilisito paategubutulilwa. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Mwenga mumlolili ng'ogha ila mngumpala na mngumkwinila, pamonga na yiwa mumlola ng'ogha hinaa. Nagha, mnguhekelela kwa kiheku kilongeleka ng'ogha kivile na ukwilikihi, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />kwaikiva mngupokela ulokola wa mpumulo wa mwenga hila ni lukani lwa ukwinila wa mwenga.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Kwa habali gha ulokola hau wala walota wa Sapanga wahakulili kwa kuyangala na kwa kulolesa kwa umaha wailongile kwa habali gha manemu yavile yangaliwahikila mwenga. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Wayesili kumanya ni lipindi ligha na mahala kugha ivile Mpumulo wa Kilisito yula awelili mghati mwa weni alangilili, pakalangiha yala mahakilo gha Kilisito yatehika na ukwilikihi hula uvile ungalihika kuulongolo. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Sapanga awagubutulili wala walota wa Sapanga yiwa wajitumikila ng'ogha weni ila wanguwatumikila mwenga pawalongili mighalu hila ivile hinaa yatangaswa kwa mwenga na wala wawatangasila mwenga Habali Maha kwa uwesa wa Mpumulo wa Sapanga yula ayeghilwi na Sapanga kuhuma kundumba. Hata watumikila wa kundumba kwa Sapanga wawelili wangupala kumanya mighalu hai.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngalilu gha mhaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Kwa nagha, myandali mawachilo gha mwenga kwa lihengu na mlikali kutali na lumatamata lula lumhekelesa ng'ogha Sapanga na mviki litumaini lya mwenga wogha kumanemu ghala mteyapokela lipindi Yesu Kilisito paatehighiliswa. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Muweli handa wana weni utundamilu, mkotoho kujumila kukovekela kangi lumatamata luhakata lula mulukolili pamuwela muumanya ng'ogha uchakaka wa Sapanga, <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />ila mngupalwa kuwela wahaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga ku ndyangilu hyogha, handa vila yula awakemili kawela. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Kwaikiva iyandikwa, “Muweli wahaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga handa vila nenga niwela.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Sapanga yula mwenga mungumkema Tati pamumyupa, ndiwa yula kangulamula wandu wogha kulandana na matendu ghao bila kubhaghula. Kwa nagha mumtundamili nesu Sapanga kwa lipindi hali livile mngutama hamu kumlimawogha handa wahenja. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Na mwenga mngumanya yiwa mkombolwa kuhuma ku ndyangilu gha mwenga ghamaha ng'ogha hula muwelili mlihi kuhuma kwa wambuyi wa mwenga ng'ogha kwa vindu vihakala handa zahabu na lidini lya feza, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />ila kwa mwahi wa utundamilu wa Kilisito yula awelili handa mwanakondolu avile na ng'ogha uhakata hata malembu. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Mweni awelili kahaghulwa na Sapanga yambila gha mlima wogha kulumbwa, ila akahighiliswa ku machuwa hagha gha mwihu kwaikiva gha twenga. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Kwa kupitila mweni, mngumkwinila Sapanga yula amhindulili kuhuma kwa wahovili na akampegha ukwilikihi, ili mukwinili Sapanga na mumtumaini.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Kwaikiva hinaa, kwa kuyitikila uchakaka, mwenga mjighulula mioyu ili kuwapala wakwinila wayenu mkiva ng'ogha na umbindingu, hinu mjipali kwa moyu wogha. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Kwaikiva gha lilando lila lya Sapanga livile na ukomu mwenga mlelwa kangi na ng'ogha handa wana wa tati anguwesa kuhova bali tati awesa ng'ogha kuhova machuwa hyogha bila mwihu. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Handa Mayandiko yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">“Kila mundu ni handa mahamba</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">na ukulu ghaki wogha ni handa uluwa wa matawa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">Mahamba yangunyala na uluwa unguguwa. <verse eid="1PE 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />Ila lilando lya Bambu lingutama machuwa yayendelela.” Lilando hali ni lila Habali Maha mtangasilwi.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Liganga lya ukomu na wandu wahaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Hinu, mleki uhakata wogha; uhwangi na mbindingu na wifu na kumlongelela mahakata mundu ghangi. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Na muweli handa wanachali mpali maweli gha chakaka gha kimpumulo ili muwesi kukula kuulokola, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />kwaikiva hinaa mwenga mmanya yiwa Bambu ni mlungwana.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Hinu muhiki kwa mweni yula avile liganga lyeni ukomu lilemilwi na wandu ila Sapanga kalihaghula na ni lya kutundamilwa kwa mweni, <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Mwenga hilahila ni handa maganga yeni ukomu mchengwa na kuwela lighuta lya kiupumulo ili muweli watambika wahaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga, myeghi matambiko gha kimpumulo yavile yangujumilwa na Sapanga kwa njila gha Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Kwaikiva Mayandiko yangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">“Yoghanila! Ninguvika liganga haku Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">liganga lya kikalilu, lihaghulilwi na lya kutundamilwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">Mundu yula atemkwinila hayu atepughanyika ng'ogha.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Kwa mwenga mngukwinila, liganga hali ni lya mapesa ngulu, ila kwa wala wakwinila ng'ogha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">“Liganga walilemili wachengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">hinaa liwela liganga likulunga lya kitamilo.”<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Kangi Mayandiko yangulonga, “ Liganga hali linguwaghola wandu walikwali, mghomba wa kuwaguwisa wandu.” Wandu wangulikwala kwaikiva wakwinila ng'ogha hula ujumbi, na ndiwa wayandalilwa kuhuma mtumbulo. <verse eid="1PE 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />IIa mwenga ni ukolu uhaghulilwi, watambika wa lighuta lya unkosi, mlima mkwilikihi, wandu ghaki Sapanga mwenibaha, mhaghulilwi kutangasa matendu maheli gha yula awakemili mhuki kulwiha, akawayingisa kumhana ghaki wa kukangasa. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Lipindi limonga mwenga muwelili ng'ogha wandu wa Sapanga, hinaa mwenga ni wandu ghaki, lipindi limonga kawawonela ng'ogha luhungu Sapanga. Hinaa mpokela luhungu lwa Sapanga.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumikila wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Waghanja ghangu, ninguwalongela nesu mwenga mkiva handa wahenja na wandu wakutyanga mumlimawogha hau! mleki lumatamata lwa kihigha lukiva lungukingamana na mpumulo. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Muweli na matendu maheli ulongulu gha wandu wala wammanya ng'ogha Sapanga, ili hata pawatepala kuwabaisila yiwa mngughola mahakata watelola matendu ghamwenga ghamaha na wamkwilikihi Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Hinu, mumtundamili kila kilongosi avikilwi na wandu, hai iweli kwa nkosi avile kilongosi mkulu, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />au vilongosi wavile kawahaghula. ili kuwanyokola wala wahakata na kuwajumila wala wagholili mighalu gha ulungwana. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Kwaikiva ni mapalu gha Sapanga, yiwa kwa kughola mighalu ghamaha mnyamalisi milando gha kisiisii gha wandu wangali mahala, <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Mlikali handa wandu pekesu, ila mkotoho kutumila upekesu wa mwenga kuhigha mighalu gha uhakata, ila mulikali handa watumikila wa Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Muwatundamili wandu wogha, muwapali walongu wa mwenga wala wamkwinila Sapanga, mumtundamili Sapanga, mutundamilili nkosi.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukovekela mlandano wa mahakilo gha Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Mwenga wahusutu, muwatundamili wakulu wa mwenga kwa utundamililu wogha, ng'ogha wala wakulu wawelili walungwana na wanyalinyali wekaghao, hata wala wawela wakalipa. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Sapanga anguhekelela ikiva mngufumilila mang'eng'eleko gha mahakili mpalwa ng'ogha kuyapokela kwaikiva mngumanya mapalo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Kwaikiva mtepokela hupo liki, pamfumilila mkitovwa kwaikiva gha mahakata? Ila ikiva mungufumilila mahakili hata pamghola ghamaha, Sapanga atewahighila kwaikiva gha nagha. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Hagha ndiwa mkemililwi, kwaikiva Kilisito mweni ahakilwi kwaikiva gha twenga, akawalekela mlandanu, hinu mgholi handa aigholile mweni. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Mweni kaghola ng'ogha sambi, hata mlomo ghaki ulongile ng'ogha uhwangi. <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Pakalighwa mweni Kawayanga ng'ogha kwa kuwawuyisila lilighu, pawamhakilili mweni kawaghola ng'ogha watili, ila avikili litumaini lyaki kwa Sapanga, yula avile ni mlamula kanguwesa kulamula maha kwa wogha. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Mweni atolili sambi sya twenga muhigha ghaki mnani gha lipingika, ili tuhovi kwaikiva gha sambi, na tulikali kwa mighalu imhekelesa Sapanga. Kwa vilonda vyaki mwenga mlamiswa. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Mwenga muwelili handa kondolu wayaghamila, ila hinaa mumhuyila mhungaji na mgholokela wa mipumulo gha mwenga.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Wadala waposilwi na walumi waposili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Hilahila mwenga wadala, muwatundamili walumi wa mwenga, ili ikiva kuvile na wandu wakwinila ng'ogha lilando lya Sapanga wawesi kukwinila kwa kulola ndyangilo gha mwenga hata ikiva muwalongela ng'ogha lilando, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />kwaikiva watelola vila ndyangilu gha mwenga handa wandu wahaghulwa kwaikiva gha Sapanga na weni kutundamila. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Kulilemba kwa mwenga kukotoho kuwela kwa panji hela, handa vila kuluka mitindu wekaweka gha hwila, kuvalila malembo wahongolili kwa zahabu na kuvalila nguu zyeni malembo, <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />ila kulilemba kwa mwenga kuweli mghati gha moyu, hula uwesa ng'ogha kusisila au hula ukologhanyika ng'ogha wa mpumulo gha nyalinyali na kuponga ivile gha kutundamila nesu kuulongolo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Kwaikiva ndiwa wailembwili wadala wa dahile wala wahaghulilwi kwaikiva gha Sapanga hagha wavikili litumaini kwa Sapanga kangi wawelili wakiwatundamila walumi ghao. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />Kwa mlandano Sala amtundamilili Abulahamu, akamkema bambu. Mwenga muwela wana wa Sala ikiva mteghola ghamaha kwa kukotoho kutila vitisu vyovyogha.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Havihavi na mwenga walumi mlikali na wadala wa mwenga kwa luhala na mwenga muwapeghi utundamilu mkimanya yiwa weni ni wandu wapweli na handa walihi pamonga na mwenga kuhupo gha ukomu mgholi nagha ili Sapanga awapeghi kukotoho kuwela na chochosi kya kukingama mayupo gha mwenga.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuhakilika kwaikiva gha kughola maha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Mghalu wa mwihu ni hau, mngupalwa mwenga wogha mlikali kwa kuyoghanilana, na mlolelani luhungu, na mngupalwa mjipali kiulongu, na muweli walungwana na mnyenyikelani. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Mkotoho kuwahuyisila wandu uhakata kwa uhakata, au lilighu kwa lilighu, ila muwahighili, kwaikiva mwenga mkemilwi na Sapanga ili mpati kulihi highili. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Handa yangulonga Mayandiko gha Sapanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">“Mweni kupala kulama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">na kulola machuwa ghatangala gha maheli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">ni lasima ajikanisi lulimi lwaki likotoho kulonga mahakata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">na milomo ghaki ileki kulonga uhwangi.”<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Lasima akotoho kughola uhakata agholi gha maheli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">lasima ahaki kulikala kwa kukotoho kulitova na kughola kulama haku kukotoho kuhuka. <verse eid="1PE 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Kwaikiva Bambu Sapanga huwalola kwa umaha wala walungwana</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">na kuwayughanila mayupo ghao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">Ila anguwapingika wandu waghola mahakata.<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Ghani atewesa kuwahakili mwenga ikiva mnguyangala kukughola ghamaha? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Ila mhighilwa hata pamhakilwa kwa kughola maha. Mkotoho kutila mighalu ghao hilahila mkotoho kuwela na holu. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Ila mumtundamili Kilisito handa Bambu mumioyu gha mwenga. Mliyandali machuwa hyogha kumyanga kila mundu yula anguwakonya milandu gha litumaini lya mghati mwa mwenga Ila kwa unyalinyali na utundamilu, <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />ila mgholi nagha kwa unyalinyali na utundamilu. Muweli na lukani lwa maha pamlighwa, ili wala wangulonga uhakata kwaikiva gha ngalilu gha mwenga handa wakilisito, waloli honi. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Hinu ni mbaha kuhakilwa kwaikiva gha kughola ghamaha, handa Sapanga aipalile, kupiti kuhakilwa kwaikiva gha kughola uhakata. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Kwaikiva Kilisito ahovili lihanja limonga weka kwaikiva gha wogha, avile ng'ogha na sambi kwaikiva gha wala weni sambi, ili awayeghi mwenga kwa Sapanga. Akomilwi kihigha ila akagholwa mkomu kiupumulo, <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />na kwa njila gha mpumulo ayendili kusitangasila sila mpumulo ziwelili mkihungo. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />Hagha ndiwa wandu wala walemili kumkwinila Sapanga pakawalindila kwa ufumilifu lipindi Nuhu paawelili akighola lisafina. Mghati mwa kyombu kila kuwelili na wandu mayaghani hela, imaanisa ni wainane hela, ndiwa walokolilwi kumasi, <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />yala masi yavile handa mlandano wa ubatisu hula unguwalokola mwenga hinaa. Ng'ogha kwaikiva gha kuhumisa ndaka kuhigha, ila ni lilaghano kwa Sapanga lingugholeka kulukani lwa maha. Ubatisu hau ndiwa unguwalokola mwenga kupitila uhinduki wa Yesu Kilisito, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />yula ayendili kundumba na hinaa kalikala mbandi gha liwoko lya kuliyila gha Sapanga, na watumikila wa kundumba wa Sapanga na wakulu na weni makakala wakiva pahi ghaki.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Kulama kyonu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Hinu kwaikiva Kilisito ahakiliwi kihigha, na mwenga hilahila mgupalwa kuwela kulukani lulalula kwaikiva mundu pakahakilwa kala kihigha atelekana na sambi. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Kuhuma hinaa na kuyendelela ingupalwa mwenga kukulama kwa mwenga kuhighalile haku kumlimawogha, mlikali ng'ogha kwa kukovekela lumatamata mhakata lwa higha, ila mukovekeli mapalo gha Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Kwaikiva lipindi lya kuyetu mtumilili lipindi litangala kukulikala kwa mwenga mkighola mighalu hila igholwa na wandu wammanya ng'ogha Sapanga hinaa ikwila. Mlikalili kungongola, lumatamata luhakata, kunywegha nesu, mihambu gha kunywegha uyimbi nesu na kuhina kwa kutikulilana, na kulitundamila ling'omung'omu kuwela ni kumyomelesa Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Hinaa, wandu hagha wamkwinila ng'ogha Sapanga wangulikangasa pawalola mkovekelana ng'ogha kangi na weni kumahakata ghao makulunga, hinu wanguwalongelela hofyo, <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />ila watepalwa kuyegha mavalangilo kuulongolo gha yula aliyandala kala kuwalamula wala wakomu na wala wahovili. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Ndiwa kwaikiva Habali Maha ikatangaswa hata kwa wala wahovili, ili walamulwi handa wandu waghangi kuhigha, ila kumpumulo walikali handa angupala Sapanga.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagholokela maha wa hupo zya Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Mwihu wa mighalu hyogha wa pabehi. Hinu muweli na kuilongosa weni na muweli mihu ili muwesi kuyupa. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Pamonga na hagha hyogha mngupalwa myangalayi kupalana kwaikiva upalo ungugubika sambi zitangala. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Mkemani kumaghuta weni kwa weni kunu mkileka kuling'ung'ula. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Kila mmonga kwa hila hupo apeghilwi na Sapanga awatumikili waghangi, handa wagholokela maha wa hupo wekaweka gha Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Mundu yula angutangasa milando ghaki iweli handa milando gha Sapanga na yula angutumikila angupalwa atumikili kwa makakala ghala apeghilwi na Sapanga ili kumighalu hyogha, Sapanga akwilikiwe kupitila Yesu Kilisito yula ukwilikihi na makakala ni vya mweni machuwa yayendelela! Yinaa.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">kuhakilwa pauwela mkilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Walongu ghangu, mkotoho kulikangasa kwa kuyeswa mayesu makulunga paghati mwa mwenga, handa kindu kya kihenja kiwakola, <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />ila mhekeleli yiwa mhakilwa pamonga na Yesu kilisito ili muwesi kuwela na kiheku kikulunga lipindi ukulu ghaki paugubutuliwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Mhighilwa ikiva wanguwalighu kwaikiva gha lihina lya Kilisito, kwaikiva Mpumulo wa Sapanga ungulikala mghati mwa mwenga. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Ila pakotoho kuwela na mundu yoyosi paghati gha mwenga kanguhakilwa kwaikiva ni mkoma wandu, mwihi au mghola mahakata, au myambusa mlitovi weni kwa weni. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Ila ikiva mundu yoyosi pahakilwa kwaikiva gha kumkovekela Yesu kilisito, akotoho kuwela na honi, ila amtundamili Sapanga, kwaikiva kapeghwa lihina hali Kilisito. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Lipindi lya ulamula lihika kala na ulamula hau ungutumbula na wandu ghaki Sapanga mweni, hinu palitumbula kwa twenga, mwihu wa wala watundamila ng'ogha Habali Maha gha Sapanga utewela ghuli? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Hilahila handa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">“Yuhu yuhu ng'ogha kwa wandu walungwana kulokolwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">hinu itewela ghuli kwa wala wandu wamtundamila ng'ogha Sapanga na weni sambi?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Hinu, wala wanguhakilwa kwa kumkwinila Sapanga, wangupalwa, kupegha mioyu ghao kwa Sapanga yula mweni kukwinilwa na wayendeleli kughola ghala ghamaha.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Ninguwaluwa nesu wagogolo wavile haku kwa mwenga nenga nivile mgogolu muyenu, na nilolili kwa mihu ghala mahakilo gha Kilisito na ni mmonga wa wala watewela kuukwilikihi hula utegubutuliwa kuulongolo. Hinu ninguwaluwa nesu, <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />mlihungi lila lipinga lya wandu wa Sapanga mpeghilwi, mlitumikili maha hata ng'ogha kwa kuhukumulwa, ila kwa kupala mwaweni handa angupala Sapanga. Mgholi lihengu hali wala ng'ogha kwa kupala mapesa, ila kwaikiva mvile na luhujulu lwa kutumikila. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Mkotoho kuwagholokela kwa makakala hagha wavikwa pahi gha ugholokela wa mwenga, ila mwenga muweli mlandano wa lipinga hali lya Sapanga. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Mweni mhunga mkulu pakahighiliswa mwenga mtepokela hupo lya ukwilikihi hila iyaghamika ng'ogha,<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />hilahila na mwenga wahongolo mngupalwa kujivika pahi gha ulongosi wa wagogolo wa mwenga. Mwenga wogha mngupalwa kuwela na kunyenyekelana, kwaikiva Mayandiko gha Sapanga yangulonga, “Sapanga hukingama na wandu weni likwinakwina, ila huwapegha highili wandu wala wangutundamila.” <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Hinu, mnyenyekeli pahi gha Sapanga yula avile na makakala nesu, ili awayinuli kwa lipindi lyaki. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Mumpapisi mweni maghaso gha mwenga hyogha, kwaikiva mweni huwavika maha mwenga.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Mlikali mihu lipindi lyogha, kwaikiva mhakata wa mwenga, Lihyukana, angutindila tindila handa himba angulunguluma akihakula mundu amlakatuli. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Muweli mgangamala kuukwinila na mumkingami hayu, mkiva mmanya yiwa walongu wa mwenga kumlimawogha wanguhakilwa na maghaso handa hagha. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Ila mwenga pamhakilwa kala kwa lipindi mayaghani, Sapanga wa manemu hyogha yula awakemili kuyingila kuukwilikihi ghaki wa machuwa yayendelela mghati gha Kilisito, mweni baha atewachenga kwa uhyonu, atewahuyisa hyonu, atewapegha makakala na kuwagangamalisa. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Uwesa unamweni baha machuwa yayendelela na yayendelela. Yinaa.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jambuso lya mwihu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Silivano kanitanga nenga kuyandika hai lihamba hupi, mlongu yula ningummanya na kumkwinila. Ningupala kuwapegha moyu na kuwalongela yiwa mghalu hau ni manemu gha Sapanga gha chakaka. Mgangamali kumanemu hagha.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Lipinga lya wandu wamkwinila Kilisito wavile baha Babeli, lihaghulilwa pamonga na mwenga wanguwajambusa. Hilahila Maliku awela handa mwana ghangu anguwajambusa. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Mlijambusi kwa kukamulana mawoko handa upalu wa Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Ninguwatakila mlikali kukotoho kutovana mwenga mvile wa Kilisito.<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>